    "sentence_translations": [
      "(1) Qian Duoduo",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was 21 years old. She worked at a school. Her work was very busy.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo liked dogs. Big dogs, little dogs, she liked them all.",
      "Qian Duoduo liked to go to the pet store. There were a lot of dogs in the pet store.",
      "",
      "",
      "There was a pet store in front of her house. Qian Duoduo liked to go there.",
      "The pet store was very big. There were a lot of cats in the store. There were also a lot of dogs in the store.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo watched the cats eating and drinking water. She watched the dogs playing. She was very happy.",
      "",
      "Little Liang worked at the pet store. He knew Qian Duoduo.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo finished work at 8 o’clock in the evening on this day.",
      "She went to the pet store to look at the cats and dogs.",
      "",
      "“Good evening! Have you finished work?” Little Liang asked.",
      "",
      "“Good evening! I have finished work,” Qian Duoduo said."
